enable justIntonation;

use "@std"
use "@audio"

Note: Phase 23 byte-identical determinism pin for the JI/Pythagorean rendering
Note: paths. Per CONTEXT.md Claude's Discretion: tutorial.flow + showcase.flow
Note: stay 12-TET (preserve v1.2 pin); this script independently pins JI/Pyth.
Note: Pitfall 5: rendering must not depend on warning emission ordering.
Note: TuningDeterminismTests xUnit Integration runs its OWN inline-source build
Note: twice (per WARNING-5) — does NOT reuse this on-disk script's WAV path.

Note: WARNING-7 fix — writeWav lives at TOP LEVEL outside the key block.
Note: The `key Cmajor { ... }` block sets tonic context for Section/Sequence
Note: note-stream `| C4 D4 ... |` resolution. Section captures Sequence at
Note: declaration time inside the key block; Buffer + writeWav happen at top
Note: level so we never mix musical-context blocks with audio I/O syntax.

tempo 120 {
    timesig 4/4 {
        key Cmajor {
            section ji_scale {
                | C4q D4q E4q F4q G4q A4q B4q C5q |
            }
        }
    }
}

Note: renderSong + writeWav at TOP LEVEL — outside the key block per WARNING-7.
Song song = [ji_scale]
Buffer audio = (renderSong song "piano")
(writeWav "/tmp/flow_test_tuning_determinism.wav" audio)

(print "JI deterministic render complete")
(print "test_tuning_determinism: PASSED")
